<P STYLE="text-align: right; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Exhibit 99.2</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">YY Group Enters New Era as YYForce, Expanding AI, Automation and Human-Robot
Workforce Strategy; Nasdaq Ticker Changes to &ldquo;YFOR&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<!-- Field: Rule-Page --><DIV STYLE="margin: 0pt auto; width: 100%"><DIV STYLE="font-size: 1pt; border-top: Black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</DIV></DIV><!-- Field: /Rule-Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><I>&nbsp;</I></P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><I>New name reflects evolution into automation and AI-enabled workforce
management and integrated facility management (IFM) infrastructure platform</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><I>&nbsp;</I></P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><I>Trading under new ticker symbol YFOR expected to commence&nbsp;September
2, 2026</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">SINGAPORE,&nbsp;Aug. 31, 2026&nbsp;/PRNewswire/ -- YY Group Holding
Limited (NASDAQ:&nbsp;<B>YYGH</B>)
(the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;), an AI-enabled workforce management platform and integrated facility management (IFM) provider operating across
Asia and beyond, today announced a corporate rebranding to YYForce Inc. (&ldquo;YYForce&rdquo;) and Nasdaq ticker symbol change to &ldquo;YFOR.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><IMG SRC="ex99-2_001.jpg" ALT=""></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">YYForce&rsquo;s new corporate logo and tagline, &ldquo;Forging Forward
Together.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The Company will operate under the name &ldquo;YYForce Inc.&rdquo; from
September&nbsp;2, 2026. The corporate name and ticker symbol change are also expected to become effective with&nbsp;Nasdaq on September&nbsp;2,
2026, with the Company&rsquo;s Class A ordinary shares expected to begin trading on the&nbsp;Nasdaq Capital Market under the new ticker symbol
&ldquo;YFOR&rdquo; at the open of business on the same day. Until that date, the Company&rsquo;s Class A ordinary shares will continue to trade
under the ticker symbol &ldquo;YYGH.&rdquo; No action is required by existing shareholders with respect to the name change or ticker update.
Outstanding stock certificates representing shares of YY Group Holding Limited will remain valid and do not need to be exchanged. The
Company&rsquo;s ISIN number will remain the same.</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&ldquo;We chose the name YY Group when our business was focused on regional
workforce solutions,&rdquo; said Mike Fu, CEO of YY Group. &ldquo;We&rsquo;ve since scaled rapidly into an AI-enabled, international platform
infrastructure company, offering a vast human capital network, integrated IFM services, human-robot co-working models, and intelligent
software that helps our clients run their businesses and properties more efficiently. Our corporate identity must evolve in parallel.
We believe the name &ldquo;YYForce&rdquo; reflects our global growth momentum, our expanding footprint across workforce management, IFM,
and commercial automation, and our dedication to driving value creation for our clients, partners, and shareholders.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Alongside the name change, YYForce has unveiled a new corporate identity,
including a refreshed logo and the tagline, &ldquo;Forging Forward Together.&rdquo; The updated identity will roll out across the Company&rsquo;s
investor relations materials, digital platforms, and site signage over the coming months.</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The corporate rebranding does not affect the Company&rsquo;s operations,
management, business strategy, or the rights of its shareholders. Existing customer contracts, purchase orders, and supplier agreements
will remain in force. Effective&nbsp;September 2, 2026, the corporate investor relations website will be updated to reflect the new brand
identity at&nbsp;<B>www.yyforce.ai</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

